* The difficulty option fields are selection buttons
!?DL&v998=171/v999>=40/v999<=43/v1000=13;
!!SN:P^Button.wav^;
!!VRy1:Sv999;
!!VRy1:-39;
!!SN:W^Arena_Config_Active_Page^/?y2;
!!SN&y2=1:W^Arena_Normal_Difficulty^/y1;
!!SN&y2=2:W^Arena_Boss_Difficulty^/y1;
!!FU(Arena_Config_Refresh):P;


* Clicking a difficulty label selects the same option
!?DL&v998=171/v999>=20/v999<=23/v1000=13;
!!SN:P^Button.wav^;
!!VRy1:Sv999;
!!VRy1:-19;
!!SN:W^Arena_Config_Active_Page^/?y2;
!!SN&y2=1:W^Arena_Normal_Difficulty^/y1;
!!SN&y2=2:W^Arena_Boss_Difficulty^/y1;
!!FU(Arena_Config_Refresh):P;


* Switch between Standard Arenas 1-15 and Boss Arenas 16-30
!?DL&v998=171/v999>=10/v999<=11/v1000=13;
!!SN:P^Button.wav^;
!!VRy1:Sv999;
!!VRy1:-9;
!!SN:W^Arena_Config_Active_Page^/y1;
!!FU(Arena_Config_Refresh):P;


